    "message": "Merge feature/rust-port (lane B) into the information lane\n\nBoth lanes' rows are in the registries. social_channel_update and\ninformation_contacts_without_messages are both gone from lib.rs and native.py, and\nwhat only they used is gone from contacts.rs. test_native_kernels.py keeps neither\nremoved kernel's tests: test_social_propagation_row.py and test_information_row.py\nhold that coverage, and the latter now has the IDs JSON escapes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
